:: AQ8 {"position":"1500,1500","size":"150,100"}
|m>[Exactly! The astronauts flew up in the upper part and returned to the main spacecraft, and then that part separated and crashed into the Moon's surface. But the lower part of Falcon is still on the Moon.]
|m>[💡 Fact: That crash was on purpose, and the seismometer left on the Moon felt the shaking!]
|m>[The astronauts went back to Earth... and we stayed here.]
|q>[Why do you think they left us?]

[[To get rid of us->AH8a]]

(link: "So we could keep collecting scientific data after they left")[(set: $score to it + 1)(go-to: "AImg")]

[[Because we were too heavy->AH8c]]

